## Work2 Boundary

Work2 includes implementation, migration and focused reporter/ingestion/rendering/privacy/SSE tests,
quick changed-path validation, a scoped product commit, deployment to the configured combined
`ts.rookaro.com` target, authenticated browser and health checks, release-cohort registration,
logical checkpoint/rebuild proof, and strict Doctor.

Work2 does not push Git, tag or publish a Tool Shed version, synchronize disconnected installs, or
close IDEA-0014, its map, this PRM, or its campaign. Those remain awaiting formal Work5 release
evidence and upward reconciliation.

## Deferred Scope

- Remote repair, update, restart, deployment, reconciliation, and credential operations.
- Modified-client detection without a separately approved privacy-safe contract.
- External notification delivery or a second telemetry subsystem.
